OL,3,GStrathclyde
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FIt will be a dry start but
OL,6,Fcloud will soon thicken with outbreaks
OL,7,Fof rain spreading northeast, becoming
OL,8,Fheavy at times. Southerly winds
OL,9,Fbecoming strong along the coast and
OL,10,Facross Kintyre and the Isles..
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FMostly cloudy with showers or
OL,13,Flonger spells of rain, these heavy at
OL,14,Ftimes. Strong southerly winds with
OL,15,Fcoastal gales developing.
OL,16,
OL,17,CTuesday:FA rather cloudy day with
OL,18,Ffrequent showers, some heavy. A very
OL,19,Fwindy day too with southwesterly gales.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
